@startuml

actor "前台用户" as User
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Backend Controller" as BackendController
participant "Backend Service" as BackendService
participant "Database" as Database

User -> Frontend: 触发购买操作
Frontend -> Frontend: 构造订单数据
Frontend -> BackendController: 发起新增订单请求
BackendController -> BackendService: 调用add方法
BackendService -> Database: 查询用户信息
Database --> BackendService: 返回用户信息
BackendService -> Database: 查询商品信息
Database --> BackendService: 返回商品信息
alt 余额不足
    BackendService --> BackendController: 抛出余额不足错误
    BackendController --> Frontend: 返回余额不足错误
else 余额充足
    BackendService -> Database: 插入订单信息
    Database --> BackendService: 返回插入结果
    BackendService -> Database: 更新用户余额
    Database --> BackendService: 返回更新结果
    BackendService -> Database: 更新商品库存
    Database --> BackendService: 返回更新结果
    BackendService --> BackendController: 返回插入结果
    BackendController --> Frontend: 返回插入结果
end

@enduml
